    "name": "Whimside",
    "steam_appid": 3064030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/85ef305795ddfe807179b57b6102a872.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" width=800 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/85ef305795ddfe807179b57b6102a872.webm?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WHIMSIDE</i></strong> is a cozy and relaxing collection game that sits at the bottom of your screen, keeping you company whether you're working, studying, or just kicking back and watching videos.  Capture and create new species of Whimlings, then unleash your creativity by decorating your very whimsical space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace, and enjoy the relaxing escape that <i>WHIMSIDE </i>offers you throughout the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/a88156365140aab6de71298ee438cb9c.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/a88156365140aab6de71298ee438cb9c.webm?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/a88156365140aab6de71298ee438cb9c.mp4?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD OF WHIMSIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off to explore the world of <strong><i>WHIMSIDE</i></strong>. Capture or hybridize Whimlings to unlock new biomes. Each biome is rich with secrets and surprises, not to mention rare new species to uncover and collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/5cc4859195b04c99bbf53eb1c6fb9a09.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" width=758 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/5cc4859195b04c99bbf53eb1c6fb9a09.webm?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/5cc4859195b04c99bbf53eb1c6fb9a09.mp4?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN YOUR OWN WHIMSICAL SPACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock a variety of decorations, empowering you to personalize your own whimsical haven - from a peaceful garden to an extravagant outdoor playground! Your favorite Whimlings can also settle in, keeping you company throughout the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR PERFECT WHIMLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse two Whimlings into a whole new creature! Every unique combination reveals a procedurally generated new species, which will help you unlock new biomes and decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/fbec20800f85e894c5ef92d5fbcdfa9a.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" width=634 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/fbec20800f85e894c5ef92d5fbcdfa9a.webm?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/fbec20800f85e894c5ef92d5fbcdfa9a.mp4?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH THE TWITCH MAGIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our special Twitch integration is designed specifically for streamers, allowing you to share your adventure with your community. Interactions happen seamlessly, with no need for commands, providing a smooth and non-intrusive experience. The more your viewers engage, the more in-game rewards you\u2019ll earn.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WHIMSIDE</i></strong> is perfect to stream alongside Just Chatting, Art, or any other content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your viewers help you spot the rarest Whimlings while you focus on something else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock bonuses thanks to viewer participation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically assign names to Whimlings based on your most active viewers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate hype trains with special in-game events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/3731df1a68d901bd36b149887d797926.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/3731df1a68d901bd36b149887d797926.apng?t=1755079136\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST AND JOIN THE ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hi, we\u2019re Toadzillart and Tadpoly, the game dev couple behind <i>WHIMSIDE</i>. Creating this enchanting universe has been a true labor of love for us. If <i>WHIMSIDE</i> inspires you, please consider adding it to your wishlist. It\u2019s the best way to support us on this creative journey. Thank you for being part of this adventure and helping to bring this whimsical world to life! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/85ef305795ddfe807179b57b6102a872.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" width=800 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/85ef305795ddfe807179b57b6102a872.webm?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WHIMSIDE</i></strong> is a cozy and relaxing collection game that sits at the bottom of your screen, keeping you company whether you're working, studying, or just kicking back and watching videos.  Capture and create new species of Whimlings, then unleash your creativity by decorating your very whimsical space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace, and enjoy the relaxing escape that <i>WHIMSIDE </i>offers you throughout the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/a88156365140aab6de71298ee438cb9c.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/a88156365140aab6de71298ee438cb9c.webm?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/a88156365140aab6de71298ee438cb9c.mp4?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD OF WHIMSIDE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off to explore the world of <strong><i>WHIMSIDE</i></strong>. Capture or hybridize Whimlings to unlock new biomes. Each biome is rich with secrets and surprises, not to mention rare new species to uncover and collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/5cc4859195b04c99bbf53eb1c6fb9a09.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" width=758 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/5cc4859195b04c99bbf53eb1c6fb9a09.webm?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/5cc4859195b04c99bbf53eb1c6fb9a09.mp4?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN YOUR OWN WHIMSICAL SPACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock a variety of decorations, empowering you to personalize your own whimsical haven - from a peaceful garden to an extravagant outdoor playground! Your favorite Whimlings can also settle in, keeping you company throughout the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR PERFECT WHIMLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse two Whimlings into a whole new creature! Every unique combination reveals a procedurally generated new species, which will help you unlock new biomes and decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/fbec20800f85e894c5ef92d5fbcdfa9a.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" width=634 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/fbec20800f85e894c5ef92d5fbcdfa9a.webm?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/fbec20800f85e894c5ef92d5fbcdfa9a.mp4?t=1755079136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH THE TWITCH MAGIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our special Twitch integration is designed specifically for streamers, allowing you to share your adventure with your community. Interactions happen seamlessly, with no need for commands, providing a smooth and non-intrusive experience. The more your viewers engage, the more in-game rewards you\u2019ll earn.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WHIMSIDE</i></strong> is perfect to stream alongside Just Chatting, Art, or any other content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your viewers help you spot the rarest Whimlings while you focus on something else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock bonuses thanks to viewer participation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically assign names to Whimlings based on your most active viewers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate hype trains with special in-game events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/3731df1a68d901bd36b149887d797926.poster.avif?t=1755079136\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064030/extras/3731df1a68d901bd36b149887d797926.apng?t=1755079136\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST AND JOIN THE ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hi, we\u2019re Toadzillart and Tadpoly, the game dev couple behind <i>WHIMSIDE</i>. Creating this enchanting universe has been a true labor of love for us. If <i>WHIMSIDE</i> inspires you, please consider adding it to your wishlist. It\u2019s the best way to support us on this creative journey. Thank you for being part of this adventure and helping to bring this whimsical world to life! </p>",
    "short_description": "A creature collection game that sits at the bottom of your screen &amp; fits easily into your routine. Whether you're working, studying, or relaxing, Whimside is always ready to offer you a cozy escape. Capture rare creatures, create new species &amp; decorate your whimsical space!",
